{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Man vs. Machine", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Robots on the Silver Screen", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 5, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 5, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Explain about technology and technical problems in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Talking about Wishes and Imaginary Situations", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">wish </span> to talk about things you do not have/do or cannot have/do.</p>You use the second conditional to talk about situations that are possible, but not likely.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you use the second conditional, you are imagining the future. You are thinking about a specific condition in the future. You are also considering the result of the condition. However, the condition is very unlikely to happen.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can also use <span class=\"italic\">should</span>, <span class=\"italic\">could</span> or <span class=\"italic\">might</span> in place of <span class=\"italic\">would</span>, in the second conditional.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Condition<br/>(Past Simple tense)</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Result<br/>(would + base form)</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If you went to see the movie in a week,</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"there might be no line.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If they stayed home,</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"they wouldn't be part of the excitement.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If you grew up reading the comic book,</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"you wouldn't want to miss it come to life on the big screen.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If you were standing  here with me,</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"you would understand what I meant.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I wish you were here so</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"you could see the movie with me.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "We use a comma after the <span class=\"italic\">if</span> clause when it is at the beginning of the sentence. This shows that the sentence is not in the natural order.", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Present Perfect Continuous vs. Present Perfect", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Both the Present Perfect and the Present Perfect Continuous are used to show that an action began in the past and is still continuing or has just finished.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"italic\">Present Perfect</span> to emphasize the completion of an action or the result.<br/>So, when you want to say what has happened so far, use the Present Perfect tense.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"italic\">Present Perfect Continuous</span> to emphasize the  length and duration of an action.<br/>So, when you want to say how long an action has been happening, use the Present Perfect Continuous tense.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Present Perfect<br/>( What \u2026 ? How much \u2026?)</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Present Perfect Continuous<br/>(How long \u2026 ?)</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">They have told us many stories predicting the rise of robots.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Science fiction writers have been predicting the rise of robots since the early 20th century.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Now CGI has made these tales easy to depict.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">They have been filming the latest sci-fi epic for the last two years.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I have stood in line to see a new robot movie many times.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If you've been waiting outside the theater with us, then you probably love robots, too!</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to predict", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to say what will happen in the future", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Science fiction writers have predicted the rise of robots.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le05ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about androids in films.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "CGI", "type": "name"}, {"content": "computer generated imagery", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The CGI in the movie made it seem like we were in space!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le05ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to depict", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to show; to represent", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: CGI has made science fiction stories easier to depict.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le05ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "seamlessly", "type": "name"}, {"content": "without problems", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: CGI seamlessly integrates the fantastic and the real.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le05ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "electrochemical", "type": "name"}, {"content": "related to electricity-made chemical changes", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: In \"The Matrix\", people fight machines that live off human body heat and electrochemical energy.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le05ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "cyborg", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a being that is part human and part machine", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There are cyborgs in the \"Star Trek\" series!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le05ob05aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "android", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a human-like robot", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: In \"Star Wars\", C-3PO was a protocol android.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le05ob05aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "enhanced", "type": "name"}, {"content": "improved in quality", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Some superheroes are enhanced humans.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le05ob05aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "geek", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who is obsessively detail oriented in one area", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We robot geeks are off to see the robotics fair.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le05ob05aud09", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "camaraderie", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a friendly feeling with people you share an experience with", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The people standing in line shared a sense of camaraderie.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le05ob05aud10", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn7le05ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Write 100 words explaining why you have been studying English.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Say how long/where/with whom you have been studying.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Explain what you have studied so far and what has or hasn't helped you move forward.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your written piece aloud alone or to another person.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I talk about my recent routines in my English studies.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about recent actions in my English studies. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about things that have or haven't helped me move forward.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "video", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "Science fiction writers have been predicting the rise of robots since the early 20th century. They have told us stories, both fascinating and terrifying. Now CGI has made these tales easy to depict, seamlessly integrating the fantastic and the real."}, {"image": "", "time": "16000", "id": 2, "text": "On the silver screen, humans have traveled through the matrix to fight a race of machines living off human body heat and electrochemical energy. Cars have transformed into fighting machines."}, {"image": "", "time": "28000", "id": 3, "text": "<p>It's opening night and people have been standing in line for hours. They want to be one of the first to see their favorite robot, cyborg, android or armor-enhanced hero.</p>If these people went to the movies a week later, there would be no line. However, if they stayed home, they wouldn't be part of the excitement or robot geek camaraderie."}, {"image": "", "time": "49500", "id": 4, "text": "<p>They would tell you with certainty that if you grew up watching a sci-fi cartoon or reading a comic book, you wouldn't want to miss it come to life on the big screen.  </p>If you've been waiting outside the theater with us, you know what I mean."}], "video_src": "engenn7le05ob05re2vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "id": 2}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about technology and gadgets.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about wishes and imaginary situations.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about recent actions and routines.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What sci-fi movies have you seen? What were the characters like?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What have you been reading lately?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " If you had a choice, would you rather read or watch a movie?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"conte